CTM BusFinder is the Official App of CTM SpA that guides you during your trips in the Area of Cagliari.

Through the App, CTM does not access to any of your  personal data stored in the device.

With CTM BusFinder you can:
- Read the last news retrieved from the CTM site and Twitter account;
- See the route of the bus lines on the map with the list of bus stops and schedules;
- Plan your journey to reach your destinations  and see the details about the relevant bus stops;
- See the bus stops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Consult the real-time data about the next bus transits and the relevant routes with reference to a bus stop of interest, also using a QR code reader; 
- See the list of ticket shops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Manage a list of preferred bus stops for a quick access;
- Purchase CTM single and season electronic tickets;
- Validate electronic tickets by scanning QR codes in CTM buses.

Everything important at Zoo Zurich in your pocket: buy a zoo ticket and scan it at the entrance directly from the Zoo app. The app shows you which animals are at home where, when there are animal presentations and feedings and where restaurants, playgrounds and toilets are located. You can find information about every animal in the zoo and create a list of your favourite animals. The Zoo Quiz sends you on a scavenger hunt, letting you get to know Zoo Zurich's animals and conservation projects better.

Functions:
- Buy your zoo ticket and scan it directly from the zoo app at the entrance;
- NEW: Save your Zoo Annual Pass in the app;
- Zoo map with all animals, events and important locations (exhibitions, restaurants, WC, playgrounds, etc.);
- Daily updated information on animal presentations and feedings;
- Background info on each animal;
- Favourites list for favourite animals;
- Zoo quiz for an exciting scavenger hunt through the zoo;
- Available in three languages: German, French and English.

Make transfers from KiwiTaxi using mobile application.
To start working with the application you need to get a login and password from your dispatcher.
The following functions are available in the application:
- viewing full information about the order;
- contacting the client;
- changing order status;
- viewing the history of completed orders;
- a section with useful articles on working at KiwiTaxi
The application requires an Internet connection and permission to send driver geolocation data.
